{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2021-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1623110400, "end_date": 1623801599, "month_true_total": 1501, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:48:40 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "93824602", "author": {"steamid": "76561198158944673", "personaname": "Duskztar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Duskztar/", "num_games_owned": 590, "num_reviews": 108, "playtime_forever": 4105, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 138, "last_played": 1751604614, "avatar": "7993dcc6516c014d60a7f131a29dba15d5622908"}, "language": "english", "review": "Decided to try it on sale. Combining borderlands style loot with rougelike runs and progression in an FPS is a great idea, I already am greatly enjoying it, I hope they continue to support this game after the full release cause it's both fun and has serious potential for more.", "timestamp_created": 1623796149, "timestamp_updated": 1623796149, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93824334", "author": {"steamid": "76561198034947924", "personaname": "Cyberwulf", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Cyberwulf9T9/", "num_games_owned": 650, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 9387, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8335, "deck_playtime_at_review": 74, "last_played": 1762667064, "avatar": "91ba93bada735e0ad61f622aac9adbe5749fa102"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of my favorite games on Steam! It took me a bit to get used to the initial grind, but give it a chance and you'll see the depth that this game will bring. I started my first endless journey today, and i'm having a blast seeing how many risks and rewards i can find to become utterly broken.\n\nThe art style and variety of weapons is a big plus for me too. Easy to read and cozy to look at, along with weapons and upgrades that allow you to create your own play-style each run. Super fun game alone and so amazing with friends. I'd highly recommend playing with buddies on the initial grind, but it isn't necessary.", "timestamp_created": 1623795649, "timestamp_updated": 1721768362, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93822234", "author": {"steamid": "76561198170894471", "personaname": "Finnick`", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/yoitsFinnick/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 91, "playtime_forever": 2684, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 100, "last_played": 1740254094, "avatar": "11f3145f3719b2282a95d1217cbf40d4bd7c2cbe"}, "language": "english", "review": "So far really loving this game, me and my friend are having a blast.\nPlayable characters are cute, gun/magic play is awesome and the bosses are really fun :)\n\nDefinitely recommend this :)", "timestamp_created": 1623792145, "timestamp_updated": 1623792145, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93820894", "author": {"steamid": "76561198090852980", "personaname": "hiffaro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198090852980/", "num_games_owned": 33